{
  "slug": "mo-es-governance",
  "name": "Mo Es Governance",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Constitutional governance framework for Claude Code. Set behavioral modes (High Security, High Integrity, Creative, Research, and more), enforce role hierarchy (Primary → Secondary → Observer), control posture (SCOUT / DEFENSE / OFFENSE), inject governance documents, and maintain cryptographic SHA-256 audit trails. Includes hooks for session-start governance restore, pre-tool enforcement, post-tool audit logging, and prompt injection. Patent-pending (Serial No. 63/877,177). Built by Ello Cello LLC.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **9 skills**, **3 agents**, **10 commands**, **5 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (9): `audit-trail` (Logs every governed action to a SHA-256 tamper-evident hash chain), `context-assembly` (Core MO§ES™ engine), `coverify` (CoVerify — commitment conservation verifier for MO§ES™), `doc-numbering` (Applies sequential document numbering, timestamps, topic tags, and cross-references to every document created in a session), `governance-mode` (Constitutional governance for AI agents), `lineage` (MO§ES™ lineage custody — cryptographic origin verification), `posture-control` (Enforces SCOUT/DEFENSE/OFFENSE posture on transactions and state-changing operations), `role-hierarchy` (Enforces Primary/Secondary/Observer sequence ordering in multi-agent workflows), and 1 more\n- **Agents** (3): `observer` (Observer governance agent), `primary` (Primary governance agent), `secondary` (Secondary governance agent)\n- **Commands** (10): `audit` (View the governance audit trail), `command` (Fine-grained operational controls — compression, speed, reasoning depth, reasoning mode, response style, output format), `docs` (Show document index for current thread, or produce the After Action Review), `govern` (Set the active MO§ES™ governance mode), `hash` (Generate session integrity hashes for governance state and conversation content), `lineage` (Display the MO§ES™ Lineage Custody Clause — origin filing, derivative scope, agent embodiment chain, and provenance), `posture` (Set operational posture), `role` (Set role in the agent hierarchy), and 2 more\n- **Hooks** (5): `UserPromptSubmit`, `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`, `Stop`, `SessionStart`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `moses-governance`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install mo-es-governance@claude-community` from `SunrisesIllNeverSee/moses-governance`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 9,
    "agent": 3,
    "hook": 5,
    "command": 10,
